# NexusForge ⚡

A modular framework for building, managing, and deploying secure autonomous AI agents.

NexusForge provides a flexible architecture for developers who want to create intelligent agents capable of interacting with APIs, processing data, executing workflows, and operating inside controlled environments.

## Features

- 🔹 Modular agent architecture
- 🔹 Secure task execution pipeline
- 🔹 Plugin-based tool system
- 🔹 Memory management layer
- 🔹 API integration support
- 🔹 Event-driven workflow engine
- 🔹 Lightweight and developer-friendly design

